type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/2447e63e050074af8344fd4dc615b36d.poster.avif?t=1772733553\" width=1170 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/2447e63e050074af8344fd4dc615b36d.webm?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/2447e63e050074af8344fd4dc615b36d.mp4?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect and keep your Painted Kingdom from burning! Lead your units to hold the line and seal every breach. Switch between water and force to extinguish or strike. Unleash powerful abilities to turn the battle in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/a34821659cf64688e346ab5d5f3a04bb.poster.avif?t=1772733553\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/a34821659cf64688e346ab5d5f3a04bb.webm?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/a34821659cf64688e346ab5d5f3a04bb.mp4?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e8963f2454fd04f41231d066017e923a.poster.avif?t=1772733553\" width=1170 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e8963f2454fd04f41231d066017e923a.webm?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e8963f2454fd04f41231d066017e923a.mp4?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfold your journey across the pages of a living book where each chapter draws from a different heritage from Europe to China. Paper, textures, music, and colors awaken with every culture\u2019s spirit, painting a world that feels alive and fragile. Face the Cinder Lords, powerful beings born from flame, each embodying the myths and fires of ancient civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/de57b5155269631d60b7cd8c207b044c.poster.avif?t=1772733553\" width=1170 height=98 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/de57b5155269631d60b7cd8c207b044c.webm?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/de57b5155269631d60b7cd8c207b044c.mp4?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e95f099df405ef8fc748f0e2796598b4.poster.avif?t=1772733553\" width=1170 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e95f099df405ef8fc748f0e2796598b4.webm?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/extras/e95f099df405ef8fc748f0e2796598b4.mp4?t=1772733553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the journey as you unlock new missions and explore the world of Painted Kingdoms. Unlock new weapons, perks, and challenges to (re)approach each mission differently, and if you feel it, compete for high scores on leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Hectiq"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3596730/a63b44e84bb6e7fa4a795ea328bfaad18c50a03a/header_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772733553","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596730/1773432771/2494bbc71ab2f19e02db5155ad17010085ee0304/1772563380/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772733327","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596730/1773432771/2494bbc71ab2f19e02db5155ad17010085ee0304/1772563380/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772733327","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3596730/1773432771/2494bbc71ab2f19e02db5155ad17010085ee0304/1772563380/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772733327","id":257297379,"name":"DemoTrailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257297379/dc17b5a8167115ddab06df3d2ebcf5ea67868e8b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1772733327"}],"name":"Painted Kingdoms: Tower Defense & Firefighting","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Proc